{"path":"io/manip/setfill","title":"std::setfill","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>setfill","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/manip/setfill","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"When used in an expression out << setfill(c) sets the fill character of the stream out to c.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/iomanip\">&lt;iomanip&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> CharT <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"coMULTI\">/*unspecified*/</span> setfill<span class=\"br0\">(</span> CharT c <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>When used in an expression <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">out <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> setfill<span class=\"br0\">(</span>c<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> sets the fill character of the stream <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">out</span></code> to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">c</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> c\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> new value for the fill character\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>An object of unspecified type such that\n</p>\n<ul><li> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">out</span></code> is an object of type <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\"><span class=\"kw1732\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_ostream</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT, Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code>, the expression <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">out <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> setfill<span class=\"br0\">(</span>c<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>\n<ul><li> has type <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\"><span class=\"kw1732\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_ostream</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT, Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span></span></code>\n</li><li> has value <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">out</span></code>\n</li><li> behaves as if it called <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">f<span class=\"br0\">(</span>out, c<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>\n</li></ul>\n</li></ul>\n<p>where the function <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">f</span></code> is defined as:\n</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw1\">class</span> CharT, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> f<span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ios\"><span class=\"kw1729\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_ios</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT, Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> str, CharT c<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"co1\">// set fill character</span>\n    str.<span class=\"me1\">fill</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>c<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>The current fill character may be obtained with <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ios/fill\">std::ostream::fill</a></span>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iomanip&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"default fill: [\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/setw\"><span class=\"kw1813\">std::<span class=\"me2\">setw</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">10</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"nu0\">42</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"]<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"setfill('*'): [\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">setfill</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">'*'</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n                                   <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/setw\"><span class=\"kw1813\">std::<span class=\"me2\">setw</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">10</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"nu0\">42</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"]<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>default fill: [        42]\nsetfill('*'): [********42]</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue183\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 183</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++98\n</td>\n<td><code>setbase</code> could only be used with<br>streams of type <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\">std::ostream</a></span>\n</td>\n<td>usable with any output<br>character stream\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ios/fill\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>fill</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  manages the fill character <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::basic_ios&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/left\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>internal</span><span>left</span><span>right</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  sets the placement of fill characters <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/setw\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>setw</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  changes the width of the next input/output field <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/manip","title":"Input/output manipulators"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::setfill","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. When used in an expression out << setfill(c) sets the fill character of the stream out to c."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"c"},{"label":"Return value","note":"An object of unspecified type such that"},{"label":"Notes","note":"The current fill character may be obtained with std::ostream::fill."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"fill","note":"manages the fill character"},{"label":"internal, left, right","note":"sets the placement of fill characters"},{"label":"setw","note":"changes the width of the next input/output field"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":218,"codeBlockCount":3}
